    "PAYMENT": {
      "source_document": "docs/ck3-native-ai/war-payment-passive-12004.md",
      "provenance_path": "D:\\workspace\\ck3_eternal_recurrence\\docs\\ck3-native-ai\\war-payment-passive-12004.md",
      "bytes": 11271,
      "sha256": "93e462f3157ab8fd1e195a692817da705f9b4fc07947da49092fe13fd7459cff",
      "line_anchors": [
        {
          "line": 30,
          "text": "费用计算器ABI是 `out_amount* = 24E86D0(CArmy*, out_amount*, optional_context*)`，实际consumer传null context，跳过presentation构建。先从Army124→完整Unit→Unit174→完整Character解析上下文；modifier key0x11B加100000，与loadedfloor比较取大。依次遍历每个有效ArRg occurrence，把current38按signed32 wrap累加，保留原始重复，不按physicalalias去重。源定义的数值图可写为："
        },
        {
          "line": 47,
          "text": "真正应用调用为 `24E8F3B ->28B9950(Character*, selector, amount, 3)`，return24E8F40。selector取 `2BAFEF0(Character)?3:0`：实际55B函数仅在28C2DF0返回对象+40的bit32置位且2BAFD80 true时返回1；未给该原始条件杜撰政府名称。"
        },
        {
          "line": 92,
          "text": "SDK复用现金查询，`payment_sampling=None` 不增加请求字段；显式 `enable` 要求 `payment_window_contract=\"same_owned_process_no_load_v1\"` 并绑定本机机器ID、实际PID/creation time、connection generation及当前player。此合同不制造loaded-game epoch；停用自然采样、读失败、断线、回档或owner变化使window失效，须重新明确启用。付款证据保留原始entry/return、账户余额、正额、真实leaf write及自然父链，不以钱包净差推实际军事费用。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "checked_in_at_frozen_head"
    },
